{"seq":10,"slug":"internal-developer-platform","title":"内部开发者平台","stage":"DONE","category":"devops-tools","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/internal-developer-platform","rating":{"composite":3.87,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.08,"verdict":"skip-for-this-profile","uScore":2}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"内部开发者平台-简介\">内部开发者平台 简介</h1><p>内部开发者平台（Internal Developer Platform, IDP）是组织为工程团队构建的自助式工具集合与服务层。它将基础设施复杂性封装为可组合的能力模块，让开发者通过标准化接口获取所需资源，而无需深入理解底层实现细节。</p>\n<p>本知识库面向平台工程师、技术架构师、工程效能团队负责人，以及任何希望在组织内推动开发者自助化的技术领导者。读者应具备基本的云原生和 DevOps 背景知识。</p>\n<p>全书分为四章，沿着从设计到落地的完整路径展开：</p>\n<p><strong>第一章 平台产品设计</strong> 探讨 IDP 的愿景定位、开发者体验度量体系，以及黄金路径与模板设计方法论。平台不是基础设施的简单包装，而是面向开发者的产品——这一章建立产品思维的基础。</p>\n<p><strong>第二章 核心能力建设</strong> 聚焦服务目录与发现机制、自助式资源供给、环境管理与编排三大技术支柱。这些是 IDP 区别于传统运维工具的核心差异化能力。</p>\n<p><strong>第三章 集成与生态</strong> 讨论 CI/CD 集成模式、可观测性集成以及安全合规护栏的设计与实现。平台的价值在于连接而非替代已有工具链。</p>\n<p><strong>第四章 推广与演进</strong> 关注采纳策略、社区建设与内源模式，以及平台成熟度模型。技术上成功的平台如果无人使用则毫无意义——这一章解决&quot;最后一公里&quot;问题。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径：先通读第一章建立全局视角，再按需深入第二、三章的技术实现，最后通过第四章理解组织变革层面的挑战。有平台建设经验的读者可直接跳至感兴趣的章节。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"platform-product-design","title":"平台产品设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/internal-developer-platform/platform-product-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"idp-vision-and-strategy","title":"IDP 愿景与战略定位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/internal-developer-platform/platform-product-design/idp-vision-and-strategy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"developer-experience-metrics","title":"开发者体验度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/internal-developer-platform/platform-product-design/developer-experience-metrics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"golden-paths-and-templates","title":"黄金路径与模板设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/internal-developer-platform/platform-product-design/golden-paths-and-templates"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"core-capabilities","title":"核心能力建设","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/internal-developer-platform/core-capabilities","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"service-catalog-and-discovery","title":"服务目录与发现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/internal-developer-platform/core-capabilities/service-catalog-and-discovery"},{"seq":2,"slug":"self-service-provisioning","title":"自助式资源供给","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/internal-developer-platform/core-capabilities/self-service-provisioning"},{"seq":3,"slug":"environment-management","title":"环境管理与编排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/internal-developer-platform/core-capabilities/environment-management"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"integration-and-ecosystem","title":"集成与生态","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/internal-developer-platform/integration-and-ecosystem","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cicd-integration-patterns","title":"CI/CD 集成模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/internal-developer-platform/integration-and-ecosystem/cicd-integration-patterns"},{"seq":2,"slug":"observability-integration","title":"可观测性集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/internal-developer-platform/integration-and-ecosystem/observability-integration"},{"seq":3,"slug":"security-compliance-guardrails","title":"安全合规护栏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/internal-developer-platform/integration-and-ecosystem/security-compliance-guardrails"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"adoption-and-evolution","title":"推广与演进","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/internal-developer-platform/adoption-and-evolution","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"adoption-strategy-and-onboarding","title":"采纳策略与引导","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/internal-developer-platform/adoption-and-evolution/adoption-strategy-and-onboarding"},{"seq":2,"slug":"community-and-inner-source","title":"社区与内源建设","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/internal-developer-platform/adoption-and-evolution/community-and-inner-source"},{"seq":3,"slug":"platform-maturity-model","title":"平台成熟度模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/internal-developer-platform/adoption-and-evolution/platform-maturity-model"}]}]}